WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:27.300
So, uh, what do you got on the case so far?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.440
Well, the disappearances have been increasing steadily

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.300
every month.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.300
And all of them were people from right here in town.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.800
So you think perhaps...

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.500
That we got a serial killer on our hands?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.780
Shhhh!!!!

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.080
You might be right.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.480
Hopefully it's just a kidnapper.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.780
Don't forget, the bodies haven't even turned
up yet.

00:00:55.079 --> 00:00:58.479
There isn't exactly a great way to hide 22
rotting corpses.

00:00:58.479 --> 00:00:59.179
Especially in this town.

00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:00.400
Is everything OK gentleman?

00:01:00.679 --> 00:01:02.079
Yeah. How's your salad?

00:01:02.079 --> 00:01:04.430
Um, it's good, it's good.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.130
Thank you.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.430
How's your, uh, chicken fricassee?

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:12.630
To be honest...

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:21.630
I don't really care for it at all.
It's kinda dry and... I don't know.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:25.930
Something just tastes *off* about it.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:30.620
I'm sorry man. You, uh, you want to try a

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:31.220
bite of my salad?

00:01:31.749 --> 00:01:35.830
Nah, that's alright. I think my whole appetite's been killed.

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:44.130
So do we have any leads at all so far?

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:47.670
Yeah, there's this one guy...

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:49.970
Hey, did I show you my new tattoo?

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.300
No. I don't think so.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.290
Check it out.

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.090
Nice! I like the design.

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.600
Yeah.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.900
Are you alright?

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.300
I think I'm gonna be sick.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:06.800
Aughhh!!!!!

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:07.500
Oh my God!

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.000
*gasps*

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Jesus!

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.000
Aughh!!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.000
Is he OK?
Hey!

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.000
Hey, need some help over here!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.000
*ambulance siren*

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:24.000
*pig squeals*

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.000
Here you go. We have your salad.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:36.900
Thank you!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:37.400
You're Welcome.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.400
And your chicken fricassee.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.000
Enjoy.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.500
Thank you.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.500
*french dinner music*

